{
  "name": "VMRay: Report on demand (Hash + URL)",
  "uuid": "84abc5e0-5b1c-4bc8-82bf-bab447bd7f24",
  "tags": [
    "Alerts",
    "Enrichment",
    "VMRay"
  ],
  "workspace": "Operation Center",
  "description": "Run by an analyst on an alert. Extracts the file hashes (file.hash.* / process.hash.*) and the http(s) url.original of the alert's first event. Hashes are looked up in VMRay's existing analyses (no quota); a URL is detonated in VMRay (consumes quota, waits up to 30 min). For each, the full VMRay report is posted as an alert comment with its screenshots, and the IOCs are pushed to an IOC collection. Before use: select your VMRay module configuration on the VMRay nodes, and set ioc_collection_id on both 'Add IOCs to IOC Collection' nodes.",
